    },
    "Unlock with Face ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face ID で解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock your journal": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日記のロックを解除します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wardrobe change": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "衣替え"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎週"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Went nowhere and sorted the photos that had piled up. A day I'll never reread, but want to keep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どこへも行かず、たまっていた写真を整理した。読み返すことはないけれど、残しておきたい日。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you fill in goes straight into the entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "埋めた言葉が、そのまま本文に入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you write here,\nonly you can read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここに書くことは、\nあなたしか読めません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where did you go?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どこへ行った?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書くこと"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yearly": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年ごと"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You own the lifetime purchase, so Nikki Plus stays active forever.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "買い切りを購入済みのため、Nikki Plus はずっと有効です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your entries live on this device first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日記は、まずこの端末の中に置かれます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your hands rested for a while,\nso we quietly locked the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "しばらく手が止まっていたので、\nそっとロックしました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your journal is encrypted on this device. Not even we, the developers, can read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日記はこの端末の中で暗号化されます。わたしたち開発者にも、中身を見ることはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your theme is saved only on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テーマはこの端末の中だけに保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
